  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add sliced almonds and cook until lightly toasted, stirring frequently.",
    "Push almonds to one side of the skillet.",
    "Add eggs to the other side and scramble until cooked through.",
    "Mix eggs with almonds.",
    "Add cooked rice to the skillet and stir-fry with eggs and almonds for 2 minutes.",
    "Add marzipan, peanut butter, honey, vanilla extract, and salt to the skillet, stirring constantly.",
    "Continue to stir-fry for another 2 minutes, until marzipan is well coated with the rice mixture.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving platter or individual plates.",
    "Sprinkle shredded coconut on top, if using.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional sliced almonds if desired."
